WEBVTT

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:06.440
Who is that? Who? Who?

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:12.710
That is the devil! Devilman! Devilman!

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:14.510
DEVILMAN

00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:21.990
This man took on the name "traitor"
He threw away everything to fight

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:25.720
His Devil Arrow is a supersonic wave
His Devil Ears can hear anything

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:29.390
His Devil Wing lets him fly through the air
His Devil Beam is a ray of heat

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:36.370
With the power of a devil inside him

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:45.240
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:56.390
This man first learned of human love
That kindness awakened him

00:00:56.690 --> 00:01:00.600
His Devil Chop has punching power
His Devil Kick has destructive power

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:04.260
His Devil Eye has X-ray power
His Devil Cutter can break through rocks

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:11.410
With the power of a devil inside him

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:20.280
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:39.240
DEMON AURORA
THE SPARKLING PRISON

00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:55.590
Aurora!
Come forth, Aurora!

00:01:56.010 --> 00:01:58.810
Aurora!
Come forth!

00:01:58.810 --> 00:02:00.760
Aurora, come forth!

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:18.110
Welcome, Aurora.

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:22.340
You are Lala's friend, correct?

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:25.780
That is correct, ma'am.

00:02:26.170 --> 00:02:28.780
Lala has betrayed our Demon Tribe.

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:30.810
I am aware.

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:33.760
She has allied herself with Devilman!

00:02:34.950 --> 00:02:37.060
Lala is far beyond despicable.

00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:40.620
And you are her friend.

00:02:40.620 --> 00:02:43.830
Do you think I will allow this?

00:02:48.760 --> 00:02:52.800
Aurora, how do you intend to
atone for your friend's sins?

00:02:54.670 --> 00:02:57.650
Answer me now, Aurora!

00:03:04.710 --> 00:03:06.990
Imagine this doll is Lala.

00:03:08.550 --> 00:03:10.260
I shall see to her like this!

00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:17.800
SHIRADO APARTMENTS

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:31.580
I'll stay here for a while.
Good evening!

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:34.850
This looks nice.

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:52.300
It's bedtime!

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:56.610
I have to get my beauty sleep.
Goodnight!

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:08.890
Who is it? No salesmen would
come all the way out here!

00:04:11.110 --> 00:04:12.420
Who's there?

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:16.960
Aurora!

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:18.420
Lala!

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:23.290
I've missed you! I've been
dying to see you again!

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:24.630
Me too.

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:36.600
I've come to warn you.
The Demon Marshal is after you.

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:40.440
Women can be so vengeful.
Be careful, understand?

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:45.410
I'm so happy, Aurora! I have
a friend who cares about me!

00:04:45.410 --> 00:04:47.190
I'm so moved!

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:52.960
But don't you worry about me.
The Demon Marshal can't get me!

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:57.390
I have the mighty Devilman on my side!

00:04:59.530 --> 00:05:03.100
- Devilman?
- That's right! He's very fond of me.

00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:07.100
He seems scary, but he's nice
once you get to know him.

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:12.740
I've heard. But, I doubt he
can defeat the Demon Marshal.

00:05:13.070 --> 00:05:17.010
Of course he can!
Easy peasy!

00:05:17.010 --> 00:05:18.920
Hey, can I meet him?

00:05:19.510 --> 00:05:20.850
Devilman?

00:05:20.850 --> 00:05:25.790
Yes. I would personally like to tell him

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:28.020
to protect my best friend, Lala.

00:05:28.020 --> 00:05:32.360
And as the most beautiful demon,
you are a perfect match for Devilman.

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:37.830
How sweet of you to say so!
Come with me.

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:41.850
Hey Akira...

00:05:43.370 --> 00:05:45.340
You look down.

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:47.710
Was my breakfast bad this morning?

00:05:47.710 --> 00:05:50.280
No, that's not it.

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:52.220
Akira!

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:55.050
Lala!

00:05:56.590 --> 00:06:01.220
Good morning, Akira.
What did you have for breakfast?

00:06:01.220 --> 00:06:03.700
Just buzz off, already.

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:06.330
There!

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:11.330
Sorry, I can't. Not when I have
to introduce you to my best friend!

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:14.470
- Your best friend?
- Yes! My best friend!

00:06:14.470 --> 00:06:15.810
Come here!

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:20.350
I'm Aurora, nice to meet you!

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:23.940
She and I were in the Demon--

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:28.650
I mean, we're cousins! Best friends too!

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:31.560
She's pretty, isn't she?
But not as pretty as me!

00:06:31.750 --> 00:06:33.190
The weirdos just keep coming.

00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:35.460
Miki, are you worried--

00:06:35.460 --> 00:06:36.900
Worried about what?!

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:39.830
- Let's go!
- Ouch! That hurts!

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:42.330
Hey, hey! Miki!
Miki! Wait!

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:43.470
Miki!

00:06:44.470 --> 00:06:47.400
- Ouch! That hurt Lala!
- It did not!

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:51.140
Leave that walking ball of
envy alone! You have me!

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:53.870
Fine, fine. What do you need me for?

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:54.980
Well...

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:56.840
If I may ask...

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:58.720
Please take care of Lala.

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:01.890
I love Lala very much.

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:09.060
Lala was unusually beautiful for a
demon, so I felt at ease with her.

00:07:11.460 --> 00:07:13.660
She was a pleasant oasis
in the Demon tribe.

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:19.440
Lala was so popular.
She was our idol and star!

00:07:21.700 --> 00:07:23.240
This idiot?

00:07:23.240 --> 00:07:27.470
I'd pay good money to find a cure
for this level of stupidity.

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:29.460
I'm a star?

00:07:29.950 --> 00:07:33.260
But, Lala was also unusually
stupid for a demon.

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:35.650
What flattery!

00:07:35.650 --> 00:07:37.690
Honestly...

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:41.290
She wasn't clever enough to deceive
me, so I felt at ease with her.

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:44.130
I could never be as stupid as her.

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:49.060
I'm an idiot?

00:07:49.060 --> 00:07:51.440
You're making me blush!

00:07:52.170 --> 00:07:54.410
She's totally hopeless!

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:57.400
Devilman stole my beloved Lala!

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:58.650
What?

00:07:58.970 --> 00:08:00.480
I hate you!

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:14.030
- Aurora, what are you doing?!
- Don't interfere!

00:08:19.760 --> 00:08:21.170
DEVI--

00:08:27.240 --> 00:08:28.410
MY eyes hurt!

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:32.380
Damn!

00:08:45.020 --> 00:08:47.900
You can't possibly see where I am!

00:08:55.530 --> 00:08:59.540
She's leaving copies behind her, so the
newest Aurora must be the real one!

00:09:14.050 --> 00:09:16.950
Akira!

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:20.620
Hang on Akira! Akira!

00:09:25.890 --> 00:09:30.340
Get your hands off him.
I shall finish him.

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:34.310
Then you will have no
ties to the human world.

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:40.580
You must know, no one can
defy the Demon Marshal and live!

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:44.240
Now, Lala.
Come to me.

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:46.230
What are you doing, you traitor?!

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:50.450
You are the traitor!

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:54.630
Liar, you are!
You betrayed our friendship!

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:56.970
Do you hear yourself, Lala?

00:09:57.490 --> 00:10:01.130
You think I'll trust you
just because you're my friend?

00:10:01.130 --> 00:10:04.870
You're just looking for an
opening so you can attack me!

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:08.600
I know that! I may be a windhead,
but I know that much!

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:13.170
No, not wind. Breeze? No, not that. Air?

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:16.140
What son of brain am I?

00:10:16.140 --> 00:10:19.350
What was it again?

00:10:19.350 --> 00:10:21.020
Hey Aurora, tell me--

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:26.460
Aurora, you're really...

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:31.030
Devil Kick!

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:37.340
Gotcha! My kick actually worked!

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:41.570
Knock it off!

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:42.950
Don't be so naive!

00:10:44.470 --> 00:10:47.540
Let me down!
I hate heights!

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:50.510
Why do I keep getting
dragged up into the sky?

00:10:50.510 --> 00:10:52.350
I'm afraid of heights!

00:10:52.350 --> 00:10:55.550
Let me go! Let me go!

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:58.120
I'm just faking!

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:11.830
Akira sure is late.

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:14.710
What is Lala's friend like?

00:11:15.970 --> 00:11:19.910
Her skin's pale and her
eyes shine like stars.

00:11:19.910 --> 00:11:23.510
And she's as lovely
as her name, Aurora!

00:11:23.510 --> 00:11:25.210
Lovelier than me?

00:11:25.210 --> 00:11:27.660
Of course!

00:11:29.420 --> 00:11:31.520
No, no! I mean of course not!

00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:33.830
- Too late!
- That's intense!

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:39.030
I'd better head out before I'm late.

00:11:39.030 --> 00:11:42.300
Wait! We're coming with you!

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:44.440
You two should take your time.

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:50.050
My sister sure is cool, huh, Miyo?

00:11:51.070 --> 00:11:53.270
Well, shall I escort you?

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:55.080
- Don't press your luck.
- Not again!

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:05.390
Honestly, Akira is so troublesome.

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:09.120
I'm late!

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:18.270
- Miki!
- Mr. Alphonne!

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:21.500
Good morning, sir!

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:24.970
Hurry it up! We're going to be late!

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:27.510
Yes, that's why I'm in a hurry.

00:12:33.010 --> 00:12:36.660
That's funny. Isn't the
school over that way?

00:12:38.490 --> 00:12:43.700
I have no sense of direction.
I'd better follow Miki!

00:12:44.090 --> 00:12:48.000
Miki! Miki! Wait! Wait!

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:52.030
Miki, don't be so cold!

00:12:52.030 --> 00:12:54.380
Miki! Miki!

00:12:59.270 --> 00:13:01.380
Miki!

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:03.860
Please wait, Miki!

00:13:06.110 --> 00:13:09.530
You can't pull the
same trick twice! Here I go!

00:13:14.420 --> 00:13:18.590
Miki! Miki, please wait! Come on!

00:13:18.590 --> 00:13:21.510
Why are you avoiding me?!

00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:28.510
I'm an adult!
You can't trick me again!

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:31.310
Wait a minute!

00:13:31.310 --> 00:13:34.450
It's clear this time?

00:13:36.280 --> 00:13:38.720
ARAI GLASS
Hey! Be careful, man!

00:13:53.090 --> 00:13:55.170
Akira! Hang on!

00:13:57.500 --> 00:13:59.000
Akira...

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:00.740
Come on, Akira!

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:03.470
Who did this to you?

00:14:04.670 --> 00:14:08.250
Akira! Hang on! Akira!

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:12.620
Maybe he'll wake up if I give him a shock.

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:16.250
Today's just not my day!

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:19.700
I'm not sure I'll make it to school alive!

00:14:26.030 --> 00:14:30.500
I saw that! As a teacher, I can't allow that!

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:35.410
Oh my, Miki looks pleased!

00:14:35.840 --> 00:14:37.110
Sir?

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:39.680
Akira!

00:14:41.110 --> 00:14:44.090
Damn Aurora...
You're gonna get it!

00:14:47.250 --> 00:14:48.780
Hold it!

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:55.490
This is for Devilman!
Aurora, brace yourself!

00:14:55.490 --> 00:14:56.200
Take that!

00:14:57.560 --> 00:14:59.930
- Knock it off!
- I got you!

00:14:59.930 --> 00:15:00.910
Take this!

00:15:02.560 --> 00:15:04.160
Lala, unhand me!

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:07.370
No way! I may be stupid,
but not that stupid!

00:15:09.370 --> 00:15:11.280
I won't let go, even if it kills me!

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:14.740
That hurt!

00:15:14.740 --> 00:15:16.880
AURORA!

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:31.670
Aurora, what are you doing?

00:15:33.630 --> 00:15:34.870
The Aurora Prison.

00:15:35.260 --> 00:15:37.830
Can you escape this prison?

00:15:52.650 --> 00:15:56.120
I hope I can get to school
without Miki killing me!

00:15:56.480 --> 00:15:59.090
You still don't get it?

00:16:04.030 --> 00:16:05.700
Akira!

00:16:06.930 --> 00:16:08.310
Akira--

00:16:12.800 --> 00:16:14.370
We're not late yet!

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:23.720
Saving the students isn't a
high priority. My job comes first!

00:16:26.180 --> 00:16:28.380
I can't be late today!

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:30.580
I'm afraid I'll get fired!

00:16:30.590 --> 00:16:31.760
Please let me go!

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:39.240
Oh no! Let me out!

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:41.300
Let me out!

00:16:42.130 --> 00:16:45.340
As you wish.
I shall tear you to pieces!

00:16:48.840 --> 00:16:50.710
Oh no! Help me!

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:55.840
What is this, Aurora?
You weren't serious, were you?!

00:16:55.840 --> 00:16:57.150
It hurts!

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:01.260
Damn...

00:17:03.480 --> 00:17:06.090
Damn Aurora!
So, this is your main attack?

00:17:06.690 --> 00:17:09.530
DEVIL!

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:16.670
You're strong, Aurora.
But let's just see!

00:17:22.800 --> 00:17:24.750
Stop pulling so hard!

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:29.250
It's pulling me in half!
Devilman, save me!

00:17:30.580 --> 00:17:33.250
He can't attack me when
he's so badly injured.

00:17:33.250 --> 00:17:34.390
You think so?

00:17:37.650 --> 00:17:40.360
Where are you?
Where are you, Devilman?!

00:17:42.420 --> 00:17:46.530
You became complacent
because of your prisons!

00:17:46.530 --> 00:17:47.530
What a shame.

00:17:48.100 --> 00:17:50.600
As you can see, I'm just fine.

00:17:52.030 --> 00:17:53.100
Unbelievable!

00:17:54.140 --> 00:17:57.440
No one could recover from
those injuries so quickly!

00:17:57.440 --> 00:17:59.540
Too bad for you!

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:02.250
That's what makes Devilman so cool!

00:18:03.780 --> 00:18:06.050
Lala, you're making me blush!

00:18:06.050 --> 00:18:09.390
Now, watch as I break out
of this shoddy prison!

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:14.290
I shouldn't have underestimated you!

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:29.410
Where are you, Devilman?

00:18:29.970 --> 00:18:33.080
I don't want to go any higher!

00:18:38.410 --> 00:18:39.820
I will not be defeated!

00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:45.690
I won't fall for the same trick twice!

00:18:48.320 --> 00:18:50.530
Take this! Devil Chop!

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:53.500
Devil Kick!

00:19:06.970 --> 00:19:08.580
Here I am!

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:10.520
Now! Lala, move it!

00:19:15.680 --> 00:19:18.790
Devil Beam!

00:19:30.330 --> 00:19:31.870
Miki!

00:19:33.330 --> 00:19:34.900
NO!

00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:36.670
Miki!

00:19:36.670 --> 00:19:40.520
Miki, you can share a kiss with an adult!

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:48.990
Miki, what's wrong?

00:19:49.320 --> 00:19:51.490
I'm fine with it, sir.

00:19:51.990 --> 00:19:54.320
Really, Miki?!

00:19:54.320 --> 00:19:58.960
At last, with my first love!

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:02.370
You don't mind kissing
your teacher? Very well!

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:12.640
Does it hurt? I bet it does.

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:14.110
- Poor thing.
- Lala!

00:20:14.110 --> 00:20:16.310
Back off, will you?

00:20:16.310 --> 00:20:18.280
I can't do that!

00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:20.080
Don't joke around!

00:20:20.080 --> 00:20:25.050
I'm not! I really
am worried about Akira!

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:49.840
No one knows; no one may know

00:20:51.580 --> 00:20:56.580
Who Devilman really is

00:20:57.420 --> 00:21:04.230
No one speaks; no one may say

00:21:04.630 --> 00:21:10.080
Who Devilman really is

00:21:10.930 --> 00:21:14.000
In the world of man, there is love

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:17.200
In the world of man, there are dreams

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:22.200
Wanting only to protect
these beautiful things,

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:53.120
No one knows; no one may know

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:59.320
Where Devilman comes from

00:21:59.810 --> 00:22:04.810
No one speaks; no one may say

00:22:06.920 --> 00:22:11.920
Where Devilman comes from

00:22:13.360 --> 00:22:16.700
For he can never go home again

00:22:16.700 --> 00:22:19.700
He wanders on a journey

00:22:19.700 --> 00:22:26.380
Now that he understands peace

00:22:26.840 --> 00:22:36.520
He'll be Devilman again,
somewhere, tomorrow

00:22:56.500 --> 00:23:01.580
Demon Marshal Lacock sends out Demon
Weathers. What magic does he possess?

00:23:04.210 --> 00:23:07.310
It's hot! What in the hell?

00:23:07.310 --> 00:23:08.850
It's like summer.

00:23:12.620 --> 00:23:16.030
A red hot sun blazes over the winter city.

00:23:16.820 --> 00:23:21.600
The sun switches back and forth,
bringing summer and winter.

00:23:24.630 --> 00:23:26.110
LIFE

00:23:28.540 --> 00:23:29.380
It's summer!

00:23:30.770 --> 00:23:33.950
...or so you think, until
it changes back to winter!

00:23:50.420 --> 00:23:51.390
So hot!

00:23:51.390 --> 00:23:53.300
So cold!

00:23:53.890 --> 00:23:55.460
It's summer again!

00:24:01.670 --> 00:24:04.950
I'll use my little trick! Like this!

00:24:13.980 --> 00:24:16.920
Devilman charges into the terrifying cold.

00:24:16.920 --> 00:24:21.800
Demon Weathers appears before him,
and attacks with demon ice.

00:24:23.020 --> 00:24:25.770
There you are, Weathers!

00:24:29.800 --> 00:24:32.570
I can't let you continue with your plan!

00:24:33.900 --> 00:24:34.640
Let's go!

00:24:37.300 --> 00:24:41.510
As Devilman struggles, Weathers
releases his hellish flames.

00:24:41.510 --> 00:24:42.880
Devilman's in peril!

00:24:42.880 --> 00:24:44.740
How will things turn out for him?

00:24:44.750 --> 00:24:49.390
Next time on Devilman:
DEMON WEATHERS,
THE SUN'S REVOLT
